{0 ocpangocairo}

The {b ocpangocairo} package provides OCaml bindings for PangoCairo, the glue
between Pango text layout and Cairo rendering. They are generated from
PangoCairo's GObject introspection data.

{1 Modules}

The library is reached as {!Ocpangocairo}, with one module per class, interface or
record, such as {!Ocpangocairo.Font} and {!Ocpangocairo.Font_map}.

{ul
{- {!Ocpangocairo.Enums} — enumerations and bitfields. }
{- {!Ocpangocairo.Raw} — the C externals and abstract types the modules above are
   built on. }
}

{1 Dependencies}

It builds on {!Ocglib} (GLib and GObject), {!Occairo}, {!Ocgio} and
{!Ocpango}.
